OL,3,ABriton rescued in Nepal nearly a week
OL,4,Aafter deadly floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British national has been rescued in
OL,7,FNepal nearly a week after deadly floods
OL,8,Fhit the country, killing more than
OL,9,F1,000 people.
OL,11,FA Nepali army spokesperson confirmed on
OL,12,FTuesday they had rescued 118 Nepalese
OL,13,Fpeople and one British male as rescue
OL,14,Fefforts continued across the region.
OL,16,FMore than 3,900 people remain missing.
OL,18,FThe British national has not yet been
OL,19,Fidentified.
